<main id="main"><section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-background" aria-hidden="true"><img id="full-hero" src="/organizers-media/global/original-native-e.png" alt="" width="1400" height="933"></div><div class="wrap hero-layout"><div class="hero-copy"><h1 id="hero-title">Bring your night<br><span>to life.</span></h1><p>Tickets for concerts, balls and theatre. <br>Simple from the first seat to the final applause.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/events?create=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Create an event <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="button secondary" href="https://cal.com/michael-bujnovsky-5srszz/ukazka">Book a demo</a></div></div><figure class="hero-lines"><span class="atlas-window" data-panel="hero"><img class="scene-art" data-scene="hero" src="/organizers-media/global/original-native-e.png" alt="Blue ink illustration of a guitarist and a concert crowd" width="768" height="512"></span></figure></div></section>
<div class="comic-story" id="how-it-works"><section class="chapter" id="seats" aria-labelledby="seats-title"><div class="wrap story-row image-first"><div class="copy"><h2 id="seats-title">Your venue.<br><span>Your seating plan.</span></h2><p>Arrange tables and chairs to match your venue. Let your guests choose where they want to sit.</p><a class="text-link" href="#seats" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore seating plans <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><figure class="comic-scene"><span class="story-set-window" data-story-row="seats"><img class="story-set-img" src="/organizers-media/global/classic-ball-en.png" alt="Guests choose a table on a seating plan at an elegant classic ball" width="888" height="1776"></span></figure></div></section>
<section class="chapter ticket-chapter" id="tickets" aria-labelledby="ticket-title"><div class="wrap story-row"><div class="copy"><h2 id="ticket-title">One link.<br><span>Every ticket.</span></h2><p>Your ticket options, your own look. One link lets guests choose their tickets, seats and dinner.</p></div><figure class="comic-scene"><a class="story-set-window story-ticket-card" data-story-row="ticket" href="/organizers-media/global/sample-ticket.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View the sample Hamlet ticket"><img class="story-set-img" src="/organizers-media/global/hamlet-ticket-en.png" alt="A hand holds two Hamlet tickets for Emma Wilson, Row 4, Seat 12" width="888" height="1776"><img class="story-real-code" src="/organizers-media/global/revised-qr.svg" alt="Sample QR code K7M9R2VX6P" width="200" height="264"></a></figure></div></section>
<section class="chapter" id="check-in" aria-labelledby="entry-title"><div class="wrap story-row image-first"><div class="copy"><h2 id="entry-title">At the door,<br><span>just use your phone.</span></h2><p>Scan the QR code with your phone to check each ticket. Then welcome your guests in.</p></div><figure class="comic-scene"><span class="story-set-window" data-story-row="door"><img class="story-set-img" src="/organizers-media/global/revised-door.png" alt="A ticket is checked with a phone at the door" width="888" height="1776"></span></figure></div></section></div>

<section class="wrap support" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="help-title"><div><h2 id="help-title">Start with<br><span>your event.</span></h2><p>Book a 30-minute walkthrough of the service and discuss setting up tickets for your event.</p><div class="support-actions"><a class="button" href="/events?create=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Create an event <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="https://cal.com/michael-bujnovsky-5srszz/ukazka" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a demo <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><p class="demo-note">Online via Google Meet. We will also discuss service pricing.</p><a class="email" href="mailto:info@festapp.net">info@festapp.net</a></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>How much does it cost?</summary><p>Pricing is agreed for your event. Guest bank transfers go directly to your account; the service fee is handled separately. Card payments are available by arrangement.</p></details><details><summary>Can I offer reserved seats and dinner?</summary><p>Yes. Create your own seating plan and offer guests specific seats and dinner options.</p></details><details><summary>How do guests receive their tickets?</summary><p>Guests receive order and ticket information by email, based on the confirmed order and payment status.</p></details><details><summary>What do I need at the door?</summary><p>A phone with a camera and access to your event check-in. Scan the ticket and confirm admission.</p></details></div></section>

